    "title": "Front Office Manager - Lite Bite Foods International Enterprises - Multiple Openings",
    "description": "We at Lite Bite Foods International Enterprises are looking for an experienced Front Office Manager based out of Lucknow. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout Lite Bite Foods International Enterprises:\nLite Bite Foods International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Plan and execute banquets, events, and MICE functions\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Train and supervise front-line staff on service standards\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in OTA Management\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in MICE\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Lite Bite Foods International Enterprises!",
